<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Keli ya Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Keli ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="im">Ibaluwa ya keli ya Yohane tsayandikighwa na Mtumighwa Yohane mne miyaka ya tisini kulawa Yesu helekighwe. Yohane ng'alongile bae ka yeye iye iyandike, ila kekema yeye imbala. Ipfinu ipfili mne ibaluwa ino ya Keli pfeghala ghendo na ipfinu ipfili mne Imbuli Inoghile yandikighwe na Yohane. Ghendoghendo hala hayokomangitsa laghitso lya Yesu lya ukwinoghela na pfayolinga ukumnoghela Yesu hamwe na malaghitso ghake (2 Yoh 1:5-6, Yoh 15:9-10). Yotogholighwa ka Yohane hayang'ali yokala Efeso tsakandika Imbuli Inoghile, na tsibaluwa ndatu. Tsibaluwa atso tsitso tsino, Ibaluwa ya Mwanduso, aino ya Keli na ya Kadatu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohane komwandikila ibaluwa ino mai yumwe iyasaghulighwe, hamwe ne iwanaghe. Yakoneka hayolonga mai na iwanaghe ang'ali yolilonga kanisa. Kuya hambele kolonga ibaluwa ino kawandikila iwanu wose we Imulungu. Yohane kandika ibaluwa ino ili awaghume ghumoyo iwanu we Imulungu na kuwakanya wakale kutali na walangulitsi wa ughutsu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:1-3 Yohane kolonga kamwandikila nani ibaluwa ayo na kowalamsa iwanu.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:4-6 Kowaghuma ghumoyo iwanu we Imulungu na kuwakumbusa laghitso ilili kulu.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:7-11 Kowakanya na walangulitsi wa ughutsu.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1:12-13 Yohane komalitsila ibaluwa yake na kowaagha iwanu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Nene nili imbala, nokwandikila ghweghwe mai yusaghulighwe ne Imulungu, hamwe ne iwanagho awala iyaniwanoghela mna ukweli. Lekeni si nene niliyeka bae yaniwanoghela, ila na awala wose iwaumanyile ukweli, <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />kwaapfila ukweli awo wokala mghati mwetu na utsokala na twetwe ghamatsuwa ghose.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Aba Imulungu na Yesu Kiristu, Imwanaghe, watutendele uluso na libatsi na watwike tseghamba mne ukweli na unoghelo.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Tsanideng'elela ghendo kuwona iwanagho wamwenga woghenda mne ukweli, ka Aba pfayatulaghitse. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Lelo, mai wangu sikwandikila bae laghitso lya sambi ila laghitso lilila lyatwinalo kulawa mwanduso. Nokulomba twinoghele. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Na uno iwo unoghelo, kukala kwa kughakinda ghamalaghitso ghake. Ka pfamuhulike kulawa mwanduso, tsakalaghitsa tukale kwa unoghelo.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Mana waghutsu wengi watsa muisi, ing'awotoghola ka Yesu Kiristu tsakatsa, kuya kawa imunu. Imunu ka ayo kamghutsu na ka mwihile wa Kiristu. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Mwalangitse mleke kwaghitsa aghala ghamsang'anile, ila mbokele ghweko ilitimile.<verse eid="2JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Imunu wowose yang'okala mne ghamalangulitso gha mbuli tsa Kiristu, ila kakongetsa ghangi mne ghamalangulitso agho, ayo kahela Imulungu. Imunu wowose iyokala mne ghamalangulitso, ayo kenawo wose weli, Aba ne Imwana. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Imunu wowose ang'atsa kuna mwemwe na ng'omghalilani bae ghamalangulitso gha mbuli tsa Kiristu, mleke kumbokela mne kaye tsenu wala kumlamsa. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Imunu wowose iyomlamsa imunu ayo, kehangila naye mne sang'ano tsake tsihile.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndamso tsa ukutsigha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Ninagho mengi gha kuwalongelani, lekeni sibama bae kutenda apfo kwa kumwandikilani, ila nobama kutsa kuna mwemwe nilonge namwe chihanga kwa chihanga, ili ndeng'elo yetu itimile.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Iwana wa dada yako iyasaghulighwe ne Imulungu, wokulamsa.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>